: "Helping Out a Co-Worker", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 9, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 17, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob09re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Making and Responding to Requests", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "It's important to be polite when you ask for something or respond to requests.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Would you mind showing me how to use the photocopier?<br><span class=\"strong\">Ken</span>: Sure, no problem.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Making a Request \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Responding to a Request\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Can you ... ?<br><br> Could you ... ?<br><br> Will you ... ?<br><br> Would you mind ... ?<br>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sure, no problem.<br><br> It would be my pleasure.<br><br>  Of course, I'd be happy to.<br>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Giving and Understanding Instructions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you give instructions on how to do something, you use these words that show the order of actions:<br><br>  First<br> Then<br> Next<br> After that<br> Finally  <br><br> To show you understand instructions, you can use these expressions:<br><br>  Alright<br> OK, I understand<br> Perfect<br> Got it<br> Cool", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ken</span>: First, let's make sure the photocopier is turned on. You turn it on with this button here.<br> <span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  I see.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "original ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the document you want to make copies of", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You put the originals on the screen or above the cover. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob09aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you talk about a photocopier.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "photocopier ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "machine used to make copies of a document ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm having a hard time using this photocopier. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob09aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "machine", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a mechanical device used to perform a task", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: You have to open the machine like this.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob09aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "button", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a place you press with your finger to select an option on a machine", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: You turn it on with this button here. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob09aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "screen ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a flat, square space on a machine like a computer or photocopier that reads or shows a document", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: Put the originals on the photocopier screen right here.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob09aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "control panel ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a part of a machine that has many options ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You need to select the paper size on the control panel. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob09aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "cover", "type": "name"}, {"content": "part of a photocopier that opens and closes over the screen ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  You can place the documents above the cover.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob09aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to get jammed ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to become stuck so something can't move", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: Could you tell what to do if the paper gets jammed?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob09aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "knob", "type": "name"}, {"content": "part of a machine you turn with your hand to select an option or cause an action  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: If you see a piece of paper, turn the knobs here to remove it. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob09aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Choose a machine you use at work.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a dialogue giving instructions on how to use the machine. Remember to use words to show the order of actions (<span class=\"italic\">First, ...</span> , <span class=\"italic\">Then, ...</span>).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Another person uses expressions to show they understand the instructions like: <span class=\"italic\">I see.</span> and <span class=\"italic\"> Got it</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice your dialogue with a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Change roles.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I think of the instructions on how to use a machine.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a dialogue of 8 - 10 lines.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I practice the dialogue.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena"}